{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_499_1","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_499","text":"成唯識寶生論科目","sortOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_499_2","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_499","text":"┌標宗[旁論一～二]　┌列舉疑義─頌一[旁論一三～一六]","sortOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_499_3","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_499","text":"│教成┬引經[旁論三～六]│夢喻通處時定─頌二[旁論一七～一九]","sortOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_499_4","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_499","text":"│└料簡[旁論七～九]│鬼喻通身不定─頌二[旁論二○～二二]","sortOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_499_5","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_499","text":"│理成┬立量[旁論一○～一二]│夢損喻通有用─頌三[旁論二三]","sortOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_499_6","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_499","text":"│└斷疑┬總通四難───┴獄喻總通一切┬正通─頌三[旁論二四]","sortOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_499_8","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_499","text":"│　│├別辨─獄卒┬非獄趣[旁論二五～三○]","sortOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_499_9","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_499","text":"│　││　│非餘趣─頌四[旁論三一～三二]","sortOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_499_10","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_499","text":"│　││　└非大種─頌五六[旁論三三～三五]","sortOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_499_11","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_499","text":"│　│└會違──密意┬說─頌七","sortOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_499_12","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_499","text":"│　└逐破七門┬現知有境─頌一五[旁論四三─四四]├境─頌八[旁論三六]","sortOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_499_13","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_499","text":"││念託境生─頌一六[旁論四五─四六]├果┬今入人空─頌九[旁論三七～三八]","sortOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_499_14","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_499","text":"││覺不知無─頌一六[旁論四七]　│　└餘入法空─頌九[旁論三九～四二]","sortOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_499_15","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_499","text":"││友教無功─頌一七[旁論四八─五○]└因┬略明違理─頌一○","sortOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_499_16","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_499","text":"││夢果同覺─頌一七[旁論五一]　└廣成無境─頌一一～一四(文缺)","sortOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_499_17","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_499","text":"││身語不成─頌一八一九[旁論五二～五四]","sortOrder":17},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_499_18","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_499","text":"│└他心無智─頌二○","sortOrder":18},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_499_19","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_499","text":"└結略(文缺)","sortOrder":19},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_499_21","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_499","text":"附旁論條目","sortOrder":21},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_499_22","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_499","text":"一唯識能得大乘道果一九夢障不生別境三七說處有力入人無我","sortOrder":22},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_499_23","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_499","text":"二無境亦成菩薩大悲二○別趣一處同見三八處治我見如倒治倒","sortOrder":23},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_499_24","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_499","text":"三解諍應先陳教二一同見不待共境三九境雖錯亂能見非無","sortOrder":24},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_499_25","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_499","text":"四二義說依大乘二二業力無實所緣四○所無自性非法軌持","sortOrder":25},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_499_26","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_499","text":"五大經得名阿含二三夢覺觸用皆無實境四一識性離言異所執色","sortOrder":26},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_499_27","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_499","text":"六依識建立三界二四立相違量助破四難四二無境有知佛得說法","sortOrder":27},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_499_28","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_499","text":"七心聚假說心聲二五經依有情說獄受苦四三最初領受自證無境","sortOrder":28},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_499_29","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_499","text":"八心所不離於心二六無間共苦同受不殊四四不離自證而有現量","sortOrder":29},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_499_30","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_499","text":"九識藴心除心所二七世趣定苦共受無別四五行解各別見憶兩殊","sortOrder":30},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_499_31","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_499","text":"一○似相不待實事　二八卒不被害非位用殊四六自證生解後見相似","sortOrder":31},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_499_32","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_499","text":"一一似相隨倒而言　二九非獄業力能成互害四七不知無難因犯不成","sortOrder":32},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_499_33","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_499","text":"一二似相隨俗共成　三○獄卒形異無苦適成唯識四八識現聲不常聞","sortOrder":33},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_499_34","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_499","text":"一三時處不託外爲境三一獄器作用卒不受苦四九展轉識非外境","sortOrder":34},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_499_35","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_499","text":"一四時處非實法差別三二獄器有分非無色例五○一佛多心異現","sortOrder":35},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_499_36","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_499","text":"一五時處無定不成違決　三三卒無苦因非增上異五一夢境不明隨心成業","sortOrder":36},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_499_37","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_499","text":"一六時處無定不可但遮　三四習依止識不自變果五二識不能績故成天災","sortOrder":37},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_499_38","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_499","text":"一七時處定解心現非惑　三五增上緣果非異相續五三業果決定業道卽成","sortOrder":38},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_499_39","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_499","text":"一八夢心不關憶念　三六離識無別色根四大五四夢心不害不成業道","sortOrder":39}],"overrides":{}}